  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "To find the $5$th term, we substitute $n=5$ into the definition of the sequence:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(n) & =3n-1 \\\\ f(5) & =3(5)-1 \\\\ f(5) & =14\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the $5$th term is $14.$",
